[LIST]
[*]App unit suite: 291 tests passing, including 17 new regression tests for folder shape matching, scroll-thumb geometry and the Android-settings hand-off.
[*]CI pipeline contract tests: 279 passing.
[*]Signed QA build, emulator smoke checks and publication handled by Jenkins. No physical-device matrix is claimed for this build.

[/LIST]
